Changes made: the calculator's criteria, rationales and answer texts were
converted into JSON workbooks (samples/ec-guidance-*); seven answer rows
with no readable text were dropped; five criteria were set to score
without gating the SEAL level. The samples/recommendations workbook
restructures the criteria into 35 paraphrased self-assessment questions
with rescaled points and rewritten SEAL descriptions.

